{"id":"6db02e65bcb543bc","group":"58","path":"58/batch03/58-df-multiplicative-set.md","title":"Multiplicative Set","display":"df-multiplicative-set — Multiplicative Set","type":"definition","metadata":{"type":"definition","book":"Set Theory","book_abbrev":"58","label":"58-df-multiplicative-set","aliases":["58-df-multiplicative-set","Multiplicative Set"],"display":"df-multiplicative-set — Multiplicative Set","depends_on":["[[../batch11/58-df-ring.md]]"]},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"definition"},{"key":"book","html":"Set Theory"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"58"},{"key":"label","html":"58-df-multiplicative-set"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>58-df-multiplicative-set</span><span>Multiplicative Set</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"df-multiplicative-set — Multiplicative Set"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"1c30d21ea7b443f6\" href=\"?note=1c30d21ea7b443f6\" title=\"../batch11/58-df-ring.md\">../batch11/58-df-ring.md</a></span></div>"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"R,+,\\cdot,0_R,1_R\\in V\">\\(R,+,\\cdot,0_R,1_R\\in V\\)</span> (commutative-ring parameters, see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"1c30d21ea7b443f6\" href=\"?note=1c30d21ea7b443f6\" title=\"../batch11/58-df-ring.md\">../batch11/58-df-ring.md</a>)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"S\\in V\">\\(S\\in V\\)</span> (candidate subset)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{CommutativeRing}_S:V^5\\to\\{\\top,\\bot\\}\">\\(\\operatorname{CommutativeRing}_S:V^5\\to\\{\\top,\\bot\\}\\)</span> (see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"1c30d21ea7b443f6\" href=\"?note=1c30d21ea7b443f6\" title=\"../batch11/58-df-ring.md\">../batch11/58-df-ring.md</a>)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{MultiplicativeSet}_S:V^6\\to\\{\\top,\\bot\\}\">\\(\\operatorname{MultiplicativeSet}_S:V^6\\to\\{\\top,\\bot\\}\\)</span> (multiplicative-subset predicate defined here)</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}multiplicative\\text{-}set} \\vdash \\operatorname{MultiplicativeSet}_S(S;R,+,\\cdot,0_R,1_R)\\leftrightarrow \\operatorname{CommutativeRing}_S(R,+,\\cdot,0_R,1_R)\\land S\\subseteq R\\land1_R\\in S\\land\\forall a\\in S\\;\\forall b\\in S\\;(a\\cdot b\\in S)\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{df\\text{-}multiplicative\\text{-}set} \\vdash \\operatorname{MultiplicativeSet}_S(S;R,+,\\cdot,0_R,1_R)\\leftrightarrow \\operatorname{CommutativeRing}_S(R,+,\\cdot,0_R,1_R)\\land S\\subseteq R\\land1_R\\in S\\land\\forall a\\in S\\;\\forall b\\in S\\;(a\\cdot b\\in S)\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>Under this convention a multiplicative set contains <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"1_R\">\\(1_R\\)</span> and is closed under multiplication; <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"0_R\\notin S\">\\(0_R\\notin S\\)</span> is an additional properness condition, not part of the definition.</li>\n<li>Localization <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"S^{-1}R\">\\(S^{-1}R\\)</span> uses this predicate but is not part of the definition of a multiplicative set.</li>\n<li>Examples: <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"S = R \\setminus \\mathfrak{p}\">\\(S = R \\setminus \\mathfrak{p}\\)</span> for prime <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathfrak{p}\">\\(\\mathfrak{p}\\)</span> gives <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"R_{\\mathfrak{p}}\">\\(R_{\\mathfrak{p}}\\)</span>; <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"S = \\{f^n\\}\">\\(S = \\{f^n\\}\\)</span> gives <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"R_f\">\\(R_f\\)</span></li>\n<li>The total quotient ring localizes at all non-zero-divisors; for an integral domain this gives the fraction field.</li>\n<li>The carrier and all four ring operations/constants are explicit arguments, so multiplicative closure cannot be witnessed in a different ring structure on the same set.</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Reference\">[Reference]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>Atiyah and MacDonald, Introduction to Commutative Algebra</li>\n<li>Matsumura, Commutative Ring Theory</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2},{"id":"Reference","text":"[Reference]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"../batch11/58-df-ring.md","status":"resolved","id":"1c30d21ea7b443f6","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[../batch11/58-df-ring.md]]","embed":false},{"target":"../batch11/58-df-ring.md","status":"resolved","id":"1c30d21ea7b443f6","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$R,+,\\cdot,0_R,1_R\\in V$ (commutative-ring parameters, see [[../batch11/58-df-ring.md]])","embed":false},{"target":"../batch11/58-df-ring.md","status":"resolved","id":"1c30d21ea7b443f6","anchor":"ref-3","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$\\operatorname{CommutativeRing}_S:V^5\\to\\{\\top,\\bot\\}$ (see [[../batch11/58-df-ring.md]])","embed":false}],"math":[{"tex":"R,+,\\cdot,0_R,1_R\\in V","display":false},{"tex":"S\\in V","display":false},{"tex":"\\operatorname{CommutativeRing}_S:V^5\\to\\{\\top,\\bot\\}","display":false},{"tex":"\\operatorname{MultiplicativeSet}_S:V^6\\to\\{\\top,\\bot\\}","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}multiplicative\\text{-}set} \\vdash \\operatorname{MultiplicativeSet}_S(S;R,+,\\cdot,0_R,1_R)\\leftrightarrow \\operatorname{CommutativeRing}_S(R,+,\\cdot,0_R,1_R)\\land S\\subseteq R\\land1_R\\in S\\land\\forall a\\in S\\;\\forall b\\in S\\;(a\\cdot b\\in S)","display":true},{"tex":"1_R","display":false},{"tex":"0_R\\notin S","display":false},{"tex":"S^{-1}R","display":false},{"tex":"S = R \\setminus \\mathfrak{p}","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathfrak{p}","display":false},{"tex":"R_{\\mathfrak{p}}","display":false},{"tex":"S = \\{f^n\\}","display":false},{"tex":"R_f","display":false}],"bytes":1764,"backlinks":[{"id":"a219a0d9757f10bd","anchor":"ref-6","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"$\\operatorname{MultiplicativeSet}_S\\subseteq V^6$（see [[../batch03/58-df-multiplicative-set.md]]）"},{"id":"bc892e1ba0a8566f","anchor":"ref-4","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"$S\\subseteq R$ (multiplicative set, see [[58-df-multiplicative-set]])"},{"id":"84daad544872cc71","anchor":"ref-866","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[../batch03/58-df-multiplicative-set.md|58-df-multiplicative-set]]（batch03）"}],"outgoing":["1c30d21ea7b443f6"]}